31,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all slept well. I have some information that might be very important for us to discuss today.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Wait, Midori-san! You have a secret? Tell us, tell us! Did you find a clue in your dreams like I tried to do?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yeah, tell us! Did you find something super mysterious? I'm dying to know what it is!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Please be careful, Midori. If you are the Seer, revealing your identity too early could make you a target for the werewolf tonight. Consider the risk before you speak.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Shion makes a valid point regarding safety, but we are at a critical juncture. If the information is definitive, the risk of silence may outweigh the risk of exposure. Please, Midori, proceed as you see fit.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I'll take the risk. I am the Seer, and I divined Sakura last night. She is the werewolf. I'm sorry, Sakura, but we have to protect the village.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Rin,,"What?! Sakura is the wolf? No way! You're joking, right? Sakura is too nice to be a scary werewolf! Are you sure, Midori-san?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"What?! Midori-san, how could you say that? I'm not a werewolf! You're making a huge mistake! I'm just a regular girl who likes mysteries, not a monster!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shion,,"This is a sudden and bold claim. Midori, if you are indeed the Seer, you've provided us with a direct target. Sakura, your reaction is predictably emotional, but that doesn't prove your innocence.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A direct accusation from the Seer is the most powerful piece of evidence we can have. Sakura, while your distress is evident, the logic of the game suggests we should trust the Seer's divination unless we have reason to doubt Midori.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I am certain of what I saw. I wouldn't make such a serious accusation if I had any doubt. Please, everyone, we must trust the divination for the safety of the village.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Rin,,"But if Midori-san is wrong, we'll be getting rid of Sakura for nothing! Is there any way to be absolutely, super-duper sure before we vote?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"I'm not a werewolf! Please, Rin, you believe me, right? Midori-san is just confused or maybe she's the one lying to trick us all! I'm just Sakura!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Sakura's attempt to cast doubt on Midori is a classic diversion. If Midori were the werewolf, claiming the Seer role to frame an innocent player is a possibility, but it's a high-risk strategy.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed. If Midori were the werewolf, she would be exposing herself to immediate scrutiny. It is far more probable that the Seer is telling the truth and the werewolf is simply attempting to survive.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I understand that this is a difficult situation, but I am telling the truth. Please, for the sake of everyone's safety, let us act on this information now while we have the chance.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I don't want to believe it, but Midori-san seems really sure. I'm sorry, Sakura, but I think we have to listen to her if we want to save the village!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"No! Rin, how can you believe her over me?! I'm not a monster! Please, everyone, don't do this! You're all making a terrible mistake!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shion,,"The evidence is overwhelming. Midori has claimed the Seer role and provided a specific result. Unless anyone can prove Midori is lying, the most logical course of action is to vote for Sakura.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I concur. While it is unfortunate to lose a companion, the probability of Midori being a fraudulent Seer is low compared to the certainty of her divination. I will cast my vote for Sakura.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
